{
  "id": "015",
  "title": "The Boss's Daughter",
  "subtitle": "My father is the boss of South Boston. Conor has driven me home since I was thirteen. The wedding to a man I do not love is in three months.",
  "penName": "Maeve Connaughton",
  "genre": "darkMafia",
  "hook": "My father is Patrick Connaughton, the boss of South Boston for thirty-one years. The man who has driven me home from school every day since I turned thirteen is Conor Devlin, my father's chief enforcer, the most dangerous man my father trusts. I have been in love with him since I was sixteen. He has been in love with me since I was nineteen. We have not touched. My father has promised me to a man I do not love because the alliance keeps the streets calm. The wedding is in three months. Conor and I have run out of time to keep being good.",
